      <h2>About East Coast Reef Divers</h2>
      <div>East Coast Reef Divers in Jambiani specializes in southeast coast and Mnemba Atoll diving with a strong focus on marine biology education and citizen science. Every dive includes a marine ecology briefing, and guests participate in coral monitoring and fish identification programs. PADI courses from Open Water to Divemaster, guided fun dives, and specialty courses in fish ID and coral restoration. Small groups led by resident marine biologist instructors. Strong community engagement with local schools and conservation NGOs.</div>
